  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uzziya Kabaka wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Uzziya bwe yali ng'aweza emyaka kkumi na mukaaga egy'obukulu, abantu bonna aba Yuda, ne bamufuula kabaka n'asikira kitaawe Amaziya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'addaabiriza Erosi, n'akiddiza Yuda nga Amaziya amaze okuziikibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzziya yali awezezza emyaka kkumi na mukaaga we yaliira obwakabaka, n'afugira emyaka amakumi ataano mu ebiri mu Yerusaalemi. Nnyina ye yali Yekkiriya ow'e Yerusaalemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'akola ebirungi mu maaso ga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", nga kitaawe Amaziya bwe yasooka okukola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'amalirira okunoonya Katonda mu biro bya Zekkaliya eyamubuuliriranga okutya Katonda. Era ebbanga lyonna lye yanoonya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Katonda n'amuwa omukisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'agenda n'alwana n'Abafirisuuti, n'amenyaamenya bbugwe wa Gaasi, ne bbugwe wa Yabune ne bbugwe wa Asudodi, n'oluvannyuma n'azimba ebibuga okumpi ne Asudodi ne mu bitundu ebirala wakati mu Bafirisuuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda n'amuyambanga ng'alwana n'Abafirisuuti, n'Abawalabu abaabeeranga mu Gulubaali, era n'Abamewunimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamoni ne bawanga Uzziya busuulu, era n'erinnya lye ne lyatiikirira n'okutuusa ku nsalo ya Misiri, kubanga yali afuuse wa maanyi nnyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzziya n'azimba eminaala mu Yerusaalemi ku wankaaki ow'oku Nsonda, ne ku wankaaki ow'omu Kiwonvu, ne mu kifo bbugwe w'akyukira, era n'agissaako bbugwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era n'azimba n'eminaala mu ddungu, ate era n'asima n'ebidiba bingi mu biwonvu ne mu lusenyi, olw'amaggana amanene ge yalina. Yalina n'abantu abaakolanga mu nnimiro ze ez'emizabbibu mu nsozi n'abaalimanga ettaka eggimu, kubanga yayagalanga nnyo okulima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzziya yalina eggye ery'abasajja abalwanyi abaatendekebwa obulungi, abaatabaalanga mu bibinja ng'emiwendo gyabwe bwe gyali, Yeyeri omuwandiisi gye yabala ne Maaseya omukungu, eyali wansi wa Kananiya, omu ku baduumizi b'eggye lya kabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuwendo gwonna awamu ogw'abakulu b'ennyumba ez'abasajja abalwanyi gwali enkumi bbiri mu lukaaga (2,600).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo be baaduumiranga eggye ery'abasajja abatendeke mu kulwana, abaawera emitwalo amakumi asatu mu kasanvu mu ebikumi bitaano (307,500), abaakuumanga kabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzziya n'awa eggye lyonna, engabo, n'amafumu, n'enkuufiira ez'ebyuma, n'ebizibaawo eby'ebyuma, n'emitego emigumu, n'envuumuulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'akozesa ebyuma mu Yerusaalemi ebyayiyizibwa abasajja abamanyirivu, ebyakozesebwanga ku minaala ne ku nkomera okulasa obusaale n'okuvuumuula amayinja amanene. Yayambibwa nnyo, n'atutumuka era erinnya lye ne lyatiikirira nnyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyokka Uzziya bwe yatutumuka, ne yeegulumiza, n'okugwa n'agwa kubanga teyali mwesigwa eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda we, n'okuyingira n'ayingira mu yeekaalu ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okwotereza obubaane ku kyoto eky'obubaane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azaliya kabona ne bakabona ba",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abalala abazira kinaana ne bagenda gy'ali,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bamuziyiza, nga bamugamba nti, \"Si mulimu gwo, Uzziya, okwotereza",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obubaane, naye mulimu gwa bakabona bazzukulu ba Alooni abaayawulibwa okwotezanga obubaane. Ffuluma ove mu watukuvu, kubanga osobezza, era tojja kusiimibwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Uzziya n'asunguwala ng'akyakutte ekyoterezo mu mukono gwe. Mu kiseera ekyo ng'asunguwalidde bakabona ng'ayimiridde ku mabbali g'ekyoto eky'obubaane mu yeekaalu ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ebigenge ne bimukwata ekyenyi kyonna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Azaliya kabona asinga obukulu ne bakabona abalala bwe bamutunuulira, ne balaba ng'akwatiddwa ebigenge mu kyenyi kye ne banguwa okumufulumya ebweru. Ate era naye yennyini n'ayagala okufuluma kubanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yali amukubye omuggo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka Uzziya n'aba mugenge okutuusa lwe yafa, ng'abeera mu nnyumba eyayawulibwa ku ndala zonna olw'obugenge bwe, nga n'obuvunaanyizibwa bwonna bumuggyibbwako, ate era nga takkirizibwa kuyingira mu yeekaalu ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.26.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Yosamu mutabani we n'atwala obuvunaanyizibwa obw'olubiri n'afuga abantu ab'eggwanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
